                    {
                        "sense_id": "7806f388-8d8c-31be-9404-e4f1fe610320",
                        "entry_id": "7bf1a6aa-be72-3a03-a75f-0eff354b12f9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "decency, propriety, decorum, convenances"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8c9126aa-c577-48e6-b8fc-0db0ee3e7e08",
                                "sense_id": "7806f388-8d8c-31be-9404-e4f1fe610320",
                                "text": "А́нна Серге́евна не хоте́ла стесня́ть молоды́х люде́й и то́лько для прили́чия не оставля́ла их сли́шком до́лго наедине́.",
                                "translation": "Anna Sergeyevna had no wish to hamper the freedom of the young people, but on account of decorum she did not leave them alone for too long.",
                                "english": "Anna Sergeyevna had no wish to hamper the freedom of the young people, but on account of decorum she did not leave them alone for too long."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
